WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:03,590
Sang Biao fast food

2
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:05,310
If it's symptomatic, just give it to me.

3
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:07,470
Don't worry about whether it's right or not, just eat it and that's it.

4
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:08,510
What if any one is useful?

5
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:11,920
Three of these five grasses are poisonous

6
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:14,000
When Shen Nong came, he was so poisonous that he drooled.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,760
Yoyo, do you want to find a shroud?

8
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:18,560
No need to wander for so long

9
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,480
Can she finally return to Meow Star?

10
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:23,920
Abandoned, picking up trash, grabbing territory, hiding from humans

11
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:27,040
It seems that I don’t feel any good things at all.

12
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,010
I don't want to sleep

13
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:31,260
What a stupid little human being.

14
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,540
She's going to die

15
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:37,510
She thought she was sleeping

16
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:38,430
Grandpa Lu said

17
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:40,950
This is made from very expensive herbs and should not be eaten randomly.

18
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:43,370
But you are poisoned, you can take one

19
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:44,730
This human genius

20
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:46,130
What did you give Sang Biao to eat?

21
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:49,420
The watch is so powerful

22
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:52,500
This medicine works better than anything I've ever taken

23
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:53,620
Ben Huihui was scared to death.

24
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:55,500
I thought you really wanted to go back to Meow Star

25
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:56,940
My life is tough

26
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:59,740
Where’s our little one, Zhu Youyou?

27
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:02,180
Can I take Yoyo to play in the square tonight?

28
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:04,260
I want to bring Yoyo to make a shining debut

29
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:08,020
Those old men and women were so amazed

30
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:09,180
That child Yoyo

31
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:10,660
I'm playing half of you in the garden

32
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:12,220
I don’t know if I peed in it or not.
